Error [E1110]: `.task` must be called on the active taskgroup handle `inner`, not `g`
  --> tests/ui/taskgroup_outside.jet:5:18
    |
  5 |             x :: g.task => {
    |                  ^
 Why: each lexical `taskgroup` block owns spawns on its bound handle; a helper can instead receive `TaskGroup` as a parameter
 Fix: write `inner.task => …`, or pass `inner` to `fn helper(group: TaskGroup)`
